CHAPTER.VERS:
Also I brought you

          {+}
         up out of the land of Egypt, and led you

          {+}
         forty years in the wilderness, to possess the land of the Amorite.

And I raised up of your

          {+}
         sons for prophets, and of your

          {+}
         young men for Nazirites. Is it not even thus, O you

          {+}
         sons of Israel? says Yahweh.

But you

          {+}
         gave the Nazirites wine to drink, and commanded the prophets, saying, Don't prophesy.

Look, I will press [you

          {+}
        ] in your

          {+}
         place, as a cart presses that is full of sheaves.
